# verification_report.json is tracked from 11.2.0: it is the model registry's
# evidence, not a local scratch file. Committing it is what lets
# test_verification_report_exists_and_valid actually run in CI (it used to skip
# on a fresh clone) and lets a reviewer see what was measured, when, and that
# zero weights were downloaded. Refresh it with
# `python scripts/verify_hf_model_registry.py`.

